{"id":"b889defd-aaaf-4c15-acc9-e81e5d5b8ea9","title":"12SEN_Cycle11","fetched":"2026-10-23T23:58:41.546Z","questions":[{"id":"53173dbb-45f0-457a-ab93-7cd22ab9301b","title":"Models of Training ML (SA, TKS 2025)","isPublished":true,"publishDate":"2025-09-01T22:21:31.749Z","syllabusId":"d1a54432-597e-4e3c-a5c6-ad7a134726e4","stimulusContentItemCollection":null,"publisher":null,"dynamicFields":null,"copyrightText":"TKS 2025","visibility":"PRIVATE","school":{"id":"7572b03a-1507-4309-950e-2a286bdcf0a4","name":"The King's School, Parramatta"},"systemId":null,"system":null,"isPublisherLocked":false,"parts":[{"id":"62c8717f-d0f9-4091-8f3d-fd90e3101902","displayIndex":0,"title":"Part 1","metadata":{"id":"c77648ce-bf7a-4833-b109-88db073ac72e","mark":4,"syllabus":{"id":"d1a54432-597e-4e3c-a5c6-ad7a134726e4","title":"Software Engineering","description":"Software Engineering Stage 6 Syllabus 2022","gradeFrom":12,"gradeTo":12,"coverageLabel":null,"curriculumCode":null,"curriculumVersion":null,"gradingScaleName":null,"publishedYear":null,"publishedDate":null},"band":null,"outcomeIds":["dcef6a21-eee4-49d1-aa3d-429cdf127cdc","880073ce-5d0d-42bf-8c8c-3fc3d64646df","72cda872-f70a-431a-a485-a9d3f0712ea1"],"topicIds":["d75b51a8-dc28-4cb8-9a78-a0c2ceb18b0f"],"subtopicIds":["7f16da58-013d-4ed1-809e-e0fe02349458"],"subtopicItemIds":["087e4674-b39e-4984-8850-09b15cdd2551"],"bandIds":["0dd4a947-034d-4bb6-846d-b00817aee3dc","266e22f1-3f8a-4fbd-95bd-e7a6221d1c65","d48b51b8-7f70-4d46-91cf-95b7bf902f0c"]},"content":{"id":"ca4ae686-2c1e-4c43-98f9-20157924e16e","contentItemCollection":{"id":"d0412fc4-3e3c-46fa-a4fc-e693f24a1089","items":[{"id":"4eb457e4-2e28-4c3e-a8a9-8aeb95773564","updatedDate":"2025-07-31T23:49:43.546Z","files":null,"type":"RICH_TEXT","text":"<p>Evaluate the role of semi-supervised support vector machines (S3VM) within the framework of software automation.</p>"}],"itemIdOrder":["4eb457e4-2e28-4c3e-a8a9-8aeb95773564"]},"contentItemMetadata":null},"answer":{"id":"4cff817a-5a1f-4e0a-b83e-3ffc44db3128","parameters":{"version":0,"type":"SHORT","extendedView":true,"settings":{"version":0,"wordLimit":true,"wordCount":120,"exactValue":false,"richText":true,"imageUpload":false,"equationEditor":false,"calculatorInterface":false},"correctValues":null},"files":null},"markingCriteriaContentItem":{"id":"720f880c-2c05-442c-8488-7bce6b042f69","updatedDate":"2025-07-31T23:51:53.045Z","files":null,"type":"MARKING_CRITERIA","criteria":[{"criterion":"<p>Clearly evaluates the role of semi-supervised support vector machines (S3VM) within the framework of software automation.&nbsp;</p>","point":"<p>4</p>"},{"criterion":"<p>Describes the role of semi-supervised support vector machines (S3VM) within the framework of software automation.&nbsp;</p>","point":"<p>3</p>"},{"criterion":"<p>Outlines how S3VMs are used within software automation.</p>","point":"<p>2</p>"},{"criterion":"<p>Provides some relevant information.</p>","point":"<p>1</p>"}]},"markingRubricContentItem":null,"markingGuidanceContentItem":null,"sampleAnswerContentItem":{"id":"e9d4cb86-1e2f-46b4-b03d-32be70dde321","updatedDate":"2025-07-31T23:48:57.579Z","files":null,"type":"RICH_TEXT","text":"<p>Semi-supervised support vector machines (S3VM) play an influential role in software automation, particularly in the area of quality assurance. S3VMs utilise the structured framework of support vector machines, expanded to integrate both labelled and unlabelled data. They help in automating the process of detecting software defects by learning from a limited set of previously identified bugs and a larger set of unlabelled code. This method optimises the testing phase by predicting potential issues in unlabelled data, thus improving the efficiency and reliability of quality assurance processes. By automating defect prediction, S3VMs minimise manual testing efforts and accelerate the development cycle, ensuring higher software quality with less resource expenditure.</p>"}}]},{"id":"a9959ac6-3817-43a0-b856-5e83fb4b7ec9","title":"Decision Tree (Draw/MC, TKS 2025)","isPublished":true,"publishDate":"2025-09-01T23:44:22.183Z","syllabusId":"d1a54432-597e-4e3c-a5c6-ad7a134726e4","stimulusContentItemCollection":{"id":"b43ea2aa-3161-42cb-b818-b51e8a5c9fdb","items":[{"id":"ebf6a453-8e0f-462f-abb0-a52369f05853","updatedDate":"2025-08-03T22:13:23.163Z","files":null,"type":"RICH_TEXT","text":"<p data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"399\">A city health department wants to create an intelligent system that advises residents on daily health precautions based on air quality and personal health status.</p>\n<ol data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"1022\">\n<li data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"816\">\n<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"528\">If the air quality index<strong data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"449\"> (AQI)</strong> is<strong> above 100</strong>, check the <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"503\">sensitivity of the person</strong> (e.g., asthma, elderly).</p>\n<ul data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"816\">\n<li data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"610\">\n<p data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"610\">If the person is <strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"563\">sensitive</strong>, <strong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"581\">stay indoors</strong> and <strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"609\">use an air purifier</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"816\">\n<p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"688\">If the person is <strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"649\">not sensitive</strong>, check the <strong data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"687\">availability of a mask</strong>.</p>\n<ul data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"816\">\n<li data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"750\">\n<p data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"750\">If a mask is <strong data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"721\">available</strong>, <strong data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"749\">wear a mask.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"816\">\n<p data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"816\">If a mask is <strong data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"787\">not available</strong>, <strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"815\">limit outdoor exposure</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"1022\">\n<p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"875\">If the <strong>AQI </strong>is <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"850\">100 or below</strong>, check the <strong data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"874\">UV index</strong>.</p>\n<ul data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"1022\">\n<li data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"953\">\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"953\">If the <strong data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"917\">UV index is high (above 7)</strong>, <strong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"952\">wear sunscreen and sunglasses</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1022\">\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1022\">If the <strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"984\">UV index is low</strong>, <strong data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1021\">enjoy outdoor activities freely</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>"}],"itemIdOrder":["ebf6a453-8e0f-462f-abb0-a52369f05853"]},"publisher":null,"dynamicFields":null,"copyrightText":"TKS 2025","visibility":"PRIVATE","school":{"id":"7572b03a-1507-4309-950e-2a286bdcf0a4","name":"The King's School, Parramatta"},"systemId":null,"system":null,"isPublisherLocked":false,"parts":[{"id":"332bff30-9e41-434e-9704-f14bf7d9b63e","displayIndex":0,"title":"Part A","metadata":{"id":"2fb84c12-4200-4be5-8531-a7b9f6698f2d","mark":3,"syllabus":{"id":"d1a54432-597e-4e3c-a5c6-ad7a134726e4","title":"Software Engineering","description":"Software Engineering Stage 6 Syllabus 2022","gradeFrom":12,"gradeTo":12,"coverageLabel":null,"curriculumCode":null,"curriculumVersion":null,"gradingScaleName":null,"publishedYear":null,"publishedDate":null},"band":null,"outcomeIds":["72cda872-f70a-431a-a485-a9d3f0712ea1"],"topicIds":["d75b51a8-dc28-4cb8-9a78-a0c2ceb18b0f"],"subtopicIds":["7f16da58-013d-4ed1-809e-e0fe02349458"],"subtopicItemIds":["394a4d34-5971-4092-974b-f90024a4ed42"],"bandIds":["266e22f1-3f8a-4fbd-95bd-e7a6221d1c65",